# Extra tagger model scan paths. One per line (semicolon-separated also works); lines starting with # are comments.
#
# When to use it: your models are not in the repo's models/ but somewhere else.
#   D:\my-taggers
#   E:\stable-diffusion-webui\models\tagger
#
# Note the difference from KOHYA_TAGGER_MODELS / --models:
#   that one **replaces** the search list entirely (set it and you lose the repo's models/ and every auto-discovered location);
#   the paths in this file are **appended** after the default list.
#
# The **order of the search roots is the priority** (a model with the same name is taken from the first hit):
#   repo models/  ->  what is listed here  ->  %LOCALAPPDATA%/kohya-dataset-tagger/models  ->  HF cache
#
# Restart the service (start.bat) after editing this file. You can also add/remove entries directly in the UI
# (tagger panel -> "Model directories..."), which takes effect immediately and writes back to this file.
#
# Copy this file to model_paths.txt and use that (the latter is the local, gitignored file).
